    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"choosing to be still\"... that sounds a lot like just giving up. like disappearing. it's funny how you put it so poetically, but isn't that just a nicer way of saying I should stop trying? if the only way to stop the \"noise\" is to not exist, then isn't that just what's actually happening?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
